WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:02.880
Hey, everyone.
嘿，大家好。

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.820
Welcome to the second drink of Product Recall.
欢迎来到《产品召回》的第二杯饮品。

3
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:09.620
This was our 50th Office Ladies episode breakdown.
这是我们《办公室女郎》播客的第50集解析。

4
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.620
Those early milestones were always so big to me.
那些早期的里程碑对我来说总是意义重大。

5
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.400
I remember thinking, oh, my God, we've done 50 of these.
我记得当时想，天哪，我们竟然已经做了50期了。

6
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:15.820
Yeah.
是啊。

7
00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.500
And this episode had great behind-the-scenes details from co-writers Brent Forrester and Justin Spitzer.
这一集里有联合编剧布伦特·福雷斯特和贾斯汀·斯皮策提供的精彩幕后细节。

8
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:27.520
Plus, we got some on-set memories from guest star Shira Scott-Astroff.
此外，我们还从客串明星希拉·斯科特-阿斯特罗夫那里得到了一些片场回忆。

9
00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:31.200
You know, she played Jamie in those scenes at the high school.
你知道，她在高中那几场戏里饰演杰米。

10
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:31.820
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

11
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.700
And, you know, this episode has some of the Office fans' favorite quotes.
而且，你知道，这一集里有一些《办公室》粉丝最喜欢的名台词。

12
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:41.680
We discussed a few of them, but according to the internet, as you like to say, Angela,
我们讨论了其中几句，但正如你常说的，安吉拉，根据互联网的说法，

13
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:48.580
there are four quotes that make the list every time, and they are all in Product Recall.
有四句台词每次都能上榜，而且它们全都出自《产品召回》这一集。

14
00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:49.620
Here's what they are.
它们分别是：

15
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.740
Number one, fact.
第一句，事实。

16
00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.000
Bears eat beets.
熊吃甜菜。

17
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.440
Bears beats Battlestar Galactica.
熊、甜菜、《太空堡垒卡拉狄加》。

18
00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:56.020
Yep.
没错。

19
00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.620
Identity theft is not a joke, Jim.
冒充他人身份可不是闹着玩的，吉姆。

20
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.820
Millions of families suffer every year.
每年有数百万个家庭因此受害。

21
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.420
Lord beer me strength.
上帝赐予我力量吧。

22
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.560
One of my favorites.
我最喜欢的台词之一。

23
00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:08.340
And from you, Angela, I don't have a headache.
还有你说的，安吉拉，“我没头疼”。

24
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.400
I'm just preparing.
“我只是在做准备”。

25
00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.880
That is a meme I get sent.
那是我经常收到的表情包。

26
00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.560
I mean, all four of those are in this episode.
我是说，这四句台词全都在这一集里。

27
00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:16.220
I know.
我知道。

28
00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:16.640
Wild.
太疯狂了。

29
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.760
You know, there are also some really good lines in the deleted scenes and the candy bag alts, too.
你知道，删减片段和糖果袋花絮里也有一些非常棒的台词。

30
00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:26.520
I thought we could dive into some, and I wanted to start with this Kelly-Angela runner.
我想我们可以深入探讨一下，我想从凯利和安吉拉的这段戏开始。

31
00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.020
We mentioned it in our breakdown, but we didn't play any of it.
我们在解析中提到了它，但没播放任何片段。

32
00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:34.620
We talk about the big fight they have because Angela is horrible at customer service.
我们谈到了她们之间的大吵，因为安吉拉的客户服务做得太烂了。

33
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:38.420
And Kelly gets frustrated and tells Angela she looks old enough to be her mother.
凯利很沮丧，告诉安吉拉她看起来老得都能当她妈了。

34
00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.240
And Angela gets really pissed off.
安吉拉被彻底激怒了。

35
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.300
She storms off.
她气冲冲地走开了。

36
00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:48.720
In a deleted scene, Kelly apologizes to Angela, hoping that Angela will then also apologize for her snarky comments.
在一个删减片段中，凯利向安吉拉道歉，希望安吉拉也能为她之前的刻薄言论道歉。

37
00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.540
It's in deleted scenes.
这在删减片段里。

38
00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.140
So Kelly comes over to accounting.
所以凯利走到会计部。

39
00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:53.640
Hey, Angela.
嘿，安吉拉。

40
00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.540
I'm sorry that I said that you were old enough to be my mother.
我很抱歉说你老得能当我妈。

41
00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:57.760
I don't know why I said that.
我不知道我为什么要那么说。

42
00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:01.560
I think I might be hypoglycemic or something, but still, it's no excuse.
我想我可能是低血糖什么的，但不管怎样，那都不是借口。

43
00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.340
So I'm very sorry.
所以我真的很抱歉。

44
00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:07.900
Oh, thank you, Kelly.
哦，谢谢你，凯利。

45
00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:16.650
And I wish I hadn't called you stupid.
我也希望我没骂你蠢。

46
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:17.610
Do you think I'm a slut?
你觉得我是荡妇吗？

47
00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.470
No, but some of your outfits are not-
不，但你有些衣服穿得……

48
00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:21.870
Apology accepted.
道歉接受了。

49
00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:22.770
I didn't apologize.
我没道歉。

50
00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.910
We're like best friends, ma'am.
我们就像最好的朋友一样，女士。

51
00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:24.210
We're not.
我们不是。

52
00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:24.830
I'll text you.
我会发短信给你。

53
00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:25.490
Don't.
别发。

54
00:02:25.610 --> 00:02:25.990
Bye, Angela.
再见，安吉拉。

55
00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:27.690
Fine.
好吧。

56
00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:30.350
Does Kelly really think they're going to be pals?
凯莉真的觉得她们能成为好朋友吗？

57
00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:39.030
I mean, this is, if Kelly is being sincere, I can see why her and Ryan have lasted so long.
我是说，如果凯莉是真心的，我能理解为什么她和瑞安能在一起这么久。

58
00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.250
It doesn't take much to win back her favor.
要赢回她的好感并不难。

59
00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.330
I mean, Angela really doesn't apologize at all.
我是说，安吉拉根本就没有道歉。

60
00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.950
But Kelly is just so, you know, delighted.
但凯莉就是那么，你知道的，高兴。

61
00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:48.770
She's pleased.
她很满意。

62
00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.350
This would have cut to an Angela talking head.
这段原本会切到安吉拉的采访镜头。

63
00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:56.750
It's also in deleted scenes, but I wanted to read you the scripted version and then a few
它也在删减片段里，但我还是想读给你听听剧本版本，还有几个

64
00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:57.690
candy bag alts.
备选台词。

65
00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:58.130
All right.
好的。

66
00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:01.090
Angela, Kelly's not so bad.
安吉拉，凯莉没那么坏。

67
00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:02.870
She really taught me something today.
她今天真的教会了我一些东西。

68
00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.590
Can you tell that I'm still lying?
你能听出我还在撒谎吗？

69
00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:06.830
Here's another one.
还有这个。

70
00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.290
I never lie, but I will fake like a melon plucker.
我从不撒谎，但我会装得像个摘瓜人一样。

71
00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.510
I have never heard that.
我从没听过这个说法。

72
00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.550
Melon plucker.
摘瓜人。

73
00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:15.510
Yep.
没错。

74
00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:19.930
Lastly, yes, Kelly apologized for her comments.
最后，是的，凯莉为她的言论道歉了。

75
00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.370
And I forgave her.
我也原谅了她。

76
00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.730
But do I no longer hate Kelly?
但我不再讨厌凯莉了吗？

77
00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.930
No, I still hate Kelly.
不，我还是讨厌凯莉。

78
00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:29.730
But knowing she was sorry makes me hate her just a little bit less.
但知道她感到抱歉，让我对她的讨厌稍微减少了一点点。

79
00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.550
There you go.
就是这样。

80
00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.850
Maybe that's the one Kelly really hopes for, that Angela hates her just a little bit less.
也许这就是凯莉真正希望的，安吉拉对她的讨厌能稍微减少一点点。

81
00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:39.970
Well, I know you dug into the candy bag alts for Kelly and Angela, but guess what?
好吧，我知道你翻了凯莉和安吉拉的备选台词，但你猜怎么着？

82
00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.050
I dove into the candy bag alts for Kevin.
我翻了凯文的备选台词。

83
00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.050
There are just so many treasures in this candy bag.
这个宝库里有太多宝贝了。

84
00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:50.710
I found a Kevin talking head to share that made me laugh so hard.
我发现了一个凯文的采访镜头，分享出来让我笑得不行。

85
00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:56.470
So remember when Kevin is sassy to Angela because she's having a tough time with the customer service line?
还记得凯文对安吉拉很刻薄，因为她在客服热线上遇到了麻烦吗？

86
00:03:56.470 --> 00:04:00.210
And he just couldn't wait to make a snarky comment about it.
他简直迫不及待地想对此发表尖酸刻薄的评论。

87
00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.670
And then he and Oscar do their little high five.
然后他和奥斯卡还击了个掌。

88
00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:03.150
Yeah.
是的。

89
00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:11.570
Well, there was a talking head for him in the candy bag where we learned that he has been holding on to some resentment toward Angela.
嗯，备选台词里有一个他的采访镜头，我们了解到他一直对安吉拉怀恨在心。

90
00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.270
And here's how it read.
内容是这样的。

91
00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:18.290
Angela caught me counting on my fingers one time and she made my life hell.
有一次安吉拉抓到我在用手指计数，她让我的生活变得像地狱一样。

92
00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:27.130
Well, today I will make her life hell for, that it says counting on fingers to four, then, four hours.
好吧，今天我要让她的生活变得像地狱一样，因为，上面写着数手指到四，然后，四个小时。

93
00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.510
It's such classic Kevin.
这太典型凯文了。

94
00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.670
Well, there are just so many great one-liners in this episode from our amazing writers.
嗯，这一集里有太多来自我们出色编剧的精彩台词了。

95
00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.350
We were so blessed.
我们太有福气了。

96
00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:39.370
We really were.
我们确实是。

97
00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:40.050
All right.
好的。

98
00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:46.470
Before we break down product recall, I have to tell you, I couldn't help but think of this Lazy Genius episode.
在分析“产品召回”这一集之前，我必须告诉你，我不禁想到了这一集《懒人天才》。

99
00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.250
You guys know Lazy Genius is on our Office Ladies Network.
你们知道《懒人天才》在我们“办公室女士”网络频道上。

100
00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.590
Kendra Adachi, amazing hoSt.
肯德拉·阿达奇，很棒的主持人。

101
00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:56.050
And she has an episode called How to Handle Bad Moods.
她有一集节目叫《如何应对坏情绪》。

102
00:04:56.050 --> 00:05:02.570
And I thought about Angela Martin a lot when I was hearing it because she's so grumpy in this episode.
听的时候我一直想到安吉拉·马丁，因为她在这一集里脾气特别暴躁。

103
00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.530
She does not want to work with Kelly Kapoor.
她根本不想和凯莉·卡普尔共事。

104
00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.890
Kendra, she could have used that episode.
肯德拉，她本可以用上那一集的建议。

105
00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:11.350
She has seven things she reminds you of when it comes to handling bad moods.
她提到了七个应对坏情绪的要点。

106
00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:15.230
And let me tell you, Angela Martin would have needed all seven of those reminders.
我跟你说，安吉拉·马丁那七点全都需要。

107
00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.010
Anyway, it's a really great listen.
总之，这节目真的很值得一听。

108
00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.070
Kendra, I loved it.
肯德拉，我很喜欢。

109
00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.870
Okay, let's get to product recall.
好了，我们进入《产品召回》这一集。

110
00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:25.060
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

111
00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.360
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

112
00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.620
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室风云》。

113
00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.860
And we're best friends.
我们是最好的朋友。

114
00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:32.720
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office Rewatch Podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你制作了《办公室风云》终极重温播客。

115
00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:39.700
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析《办公室风云》的一集，并分享只有我们两个亲历者才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

116
00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.840
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是《办公室女士》。

117
00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.320
Howdy, Ange.
你好啊，安吉。

118
00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.780
Bonjour, Jenna.
你好，珍娜。

119
00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.300
Oh.
噢。

120
00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:52.160
Oh, that's going to kind of come up later in this episode.
噢，这一集后面会提到这个。

121
00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:54.100
There's going to be some accents later.
后面会有一些口音出现。

122
00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:54.920
There are.
确实会有。

123
00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.740
Oh, it's fun accent day.
噢，今天是趣味口音日。

124
00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:57.280
Oh, no.
噢，不。

125
00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.440
People are turning us off.
大家要关掉节目了。

126
00:05:58.660 --> 00:05:59.120
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

127
00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.940
They're like, oh, no, it's accent day.
他们会想，噢不，又是口音日。

128
00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:01.660
Guys, it's okay.
伙计们，没事的。

129
00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:02.700
We won't go crazy.
我们不会乱来的。

130
00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.200
Yeah, this is a fun one, Jenna.
是啊，这一集很有趣，珍娜。

131
00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.340
Tell them what we're doing today.
告诉大家我们今天要讲什么。

132
00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:17.420
We are doing Product Recall Season 3, Episode 20, written by Justin Spitzer and Brent Forrester and directed by Randall Einhorn.
我们要讲的是《产品召回》，第三季第20集，由贾斯汀·斯皮策和布伦特·福雷斯特编剧，兰德尔·艾因霍恩执导。

133
00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.840
Randall, I was so excited when Randall got to direct.
兰德尔，当兰德尔能执导时我太兴奋了。

134
00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:22.040
We'll get into that.
我们待会儿会细说。

135
00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.320
But, you know, Randall was our cinematographer.
要知道，兰德尔曾是我们的摄影指导。

136
00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:26.800
So, this was really fun for him and fun for us.
所以，这对他是件乐事，对我们也一样。

137
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.480
Did you know that Randall directed the most episodes of The Office?
你知道兰德尔执导了《办公室风云》最多的集数吗？

138
00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:32.840
No, I did not.
不，我不知道。

139
00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:33.940
Crazy, right?
很疯狂吧？

140
00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:35.560
I think he did 15.
我想他执导了15集。

141
00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.420
That is so wild.
太惊人了。

142
00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:38.760
Well, I love that even more.
嗯，我更喜欢他了。

143
00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.260
Well, I am ready for a summary, Angela.
好了，安吉拉，我准备好听剧情梗概了。

144
00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.600
But I've got a little special something.
但我准备了一点特别的东西。

145
00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:44.800
Sam?
萨姆？

146
00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.100
It's Angela and Jenna.
是安吉拉和珍娜。

147
00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:47.880
Here we go.
开始吧。

148
00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.960
Read The Office Episode.
阅读《办公室风云》剧集。

149
00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.240
Do-do-wop summary.
嘟嘟哇风格的剧情梗概。

150
00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.000
What?
什么？

151
00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:54.040
What?
什么？

152
00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.350
So adorable.
太可爱了。

153
00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.090
Isn't that so cool?
这不是很酷吗？

154
00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.390
It's so cute.
