00:47:27.550 --> 00:47:29.030
She was 27 years old.
她当时27岁。

1051
00:47:29.210 --> 00:47:33.510
She said she was older than John Krasinski and only five years younger than Ed HelMs.
她说她比约翰·卡拉辛斯基大，只比艾德·赫尔姆斯小五岁。

1052
00:47:33.730 --> 00:47:34.790
Baby face.
娃娃脸。

1053
00:47:35.090 --> 00:47:35.870
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

