00:48:59.350 --> 00:49:01.270
We have four rescues.
我们有四只救援动物。

1077
00:49:01.430 --> 00:49:03.070
I love little rescue animals.
我爱小救援动物。

1078
00:49:03.070 --> 00:49:04.630
That makes me so happy.
这让我太开心了。

1079
00:49:05.130 --> 00:49:05.850
I know.
我知道。

