And there's a great deleted scene with him and Creed where he recognizes Creed.
有一个很棒的删减片段，他和克里德在一起，他认出了克里德。

1094
00:49:43.850 --> 00:49:46.170
He's like, wait, Creed Bratton from the grassroots.
他说，等等，你是草根乐队的克里德·布拉顿。

1095
00:49:46.830 --> 00:49:50.150
Jenna, he basically calls Creed out as himself.
珍娜，他基本上是当面揭穿了克里德的真实身份。

1096
00:49:50.590 --> 00:49:51.190
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1097
00:49:51.250 --> 00:49:52.390
And it got deleted again.
结果又被删了。

1098
00:49:53.050 --> 00:49:55.730
