It got deleted out of Booze Cruise.
它在《酒水游轮》那一集里被删了。

1100
00:49:57.530 --> 00:50:03.690
It got deleted out of what was the other episode where we found out that he stole his name from someone in prison, the convict.
它在另一集里也被删了，就是我们发现他从监狱里的人那里偷了名字的那一集，《罪犯》。

1101
00:50:03.870 --> 00:50:04.930
And now again.
现在再来一遍。

1102
00:50:05.270 --> 00:50:08.830
So Chad Light goes, Creed Bratton from the grassroots?
所以查德·莱特走过来，问克里德·布拉顿是不是来自基层？

1103
00:50:09.290 --> 00:50:10.370
And Creed's like, yeah.
克里德就说，没错。

